Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}{\pos(792,526)}Д{\fs55}у{\fs}ш
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:49.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:51.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Sana, Martini
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:53.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, tommo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.44,0:01:37.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Poor child
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:41.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Here, eat a little
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.11,0:01:42.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:45.95,general text,,0,0,0,,eat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:51.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll bring you some more meat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:53.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Chew slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:35.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.35,0:03:29.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Gon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:35.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I asked you to let me know if something happens to him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:37.81,general text,,0,0,0,,How could you allow this to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:40.44,general text,,0,0,0,,He comes to his senses, saturated with human energy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.52,0:03:42.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Becomes normal again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.11,0:03:43.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Your son has gone wild
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:49.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I will take his soul
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:51.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t allow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:54.54,general text,,0,0,0,,You turned my son into a soul swallower!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.62,0:03:56.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Get him a new body,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:03:59.13,general text,,0,0,0,,or feed with human souls!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:01.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring back my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.71,0:04:03.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Give it back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.09,0:04:06.17,general text,,0,0,0,,If it comes up that I\N used forbidden magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.18,0:04:08.76,general text,,0,0,0,,end for both of us
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:11.01,general text,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:11.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:18.69,general text,,0,0,0,,No, please! Gon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.56,0:04:22.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Stay with me a little longer
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:23.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Son...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.43,0:05:39.98,italics,,0,0,0,,Why do the bodies of soul swallowers turn to stones when they run wild?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:43.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Cracks form when absorbed souls conflict with the body
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:46.48,general text,,0,0,0,,This leads to loss of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:49.74,general text,,0,0,0,,This is already the eighth feral
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:52.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it’s time to stop this
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:55.12,general text,,0,0,0,,You must go to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:59.91,general text,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is interested in a new spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.00,0:06:01.67,general text,,0,0,0,,which you tried to master
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:37.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:41.54,general text,,0,0,0,,you are learning a new spell
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:45.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Nothing significant. Yes, just for fun
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.33,0:06:49.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I know that I can’t ask to live longer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.67,0:06:50.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Only this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:54.09,general text,,0,0,0,,it upsets me that I don’t have an heir
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:56.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I wish you a speedy recovery
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:07:00.22,general text,,0,0,0,,This weak body is not capable of anything
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:03.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I would have a chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:07.94,general text,,0,0,0,,may my body be healthy and young
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:12.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Body exchange is not possible
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:18.41,general text,,0,0,0,,But you can
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:23.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Alchemy of Souls
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.13,0:07:34.01,general text,,0,0,0,,This is forbidden magic
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.09,0:07:37.39,general text,,0,0,0,,If the body and soul do not merge, you can turn into an evil spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.47,0:07:39.05,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:41.68,general text,,0,0,0,,move the king’s soul into someone else’s body?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.77,0:07:44.18,general text,,0,0,0,,What about your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:49.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Only for seven days
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:51.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's swap bodies for a week
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:58.07,italics,,0,0,0,,I heard you transferred a soul into a dead man's body
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.87,0:08:01.49,general text,,0,0,0,,And this soul lived in a new body for six months
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:06.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I am a king, the heavens protect me. And you are the best magician in the country
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:08.46,general text,,0,0,0,,So what to worry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:13.05,general text,,0,0,0,,And in a week you will return everything as it was
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.34,0:08:19.30,general text,,0,0,0,,You can do what they can
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.39,0:08:20.89,general text,,0,0,0,,only the strongest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:24.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you're wasting your time
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:26.06,general text,,0,0,0,,moving souls into dead bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:32.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:34.53,general text,,0,0,0,,give the king a new body
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:18.02,general text,,0,0,0,,The king and I swapped bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:28.99,italics,,0,0,0,,I must make Do Hwa mine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:31.58,italics,,0,0,0,,If she gets pregnant, then the child is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:35.33,general text,,0,0,0,,To Praise...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.75,0:11:40.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Do Hwa,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.21,0:11:43.84,general text,,0,0,0,,you are very beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.98,0:11:57.52,general text,,0,0,0,,No, this cannot be allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.07,0:12:04.90,general text,,0,0,0,,This cannot be allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.57,0:12:06.78,general text,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:32.18,italics,,0,0,0,,The power of heaven moved the wind, clouds and rain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.68,0:12:34.31,italics,,0,0,0,,Having reached the earth, this force
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.89,0:12:38.10,italics,,0,0,0,,created enormous energy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:40.56,italics,,0,0,0,,An entire country was built on Lake Gyeongcheongdaeho
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.65,0:12:42.61,italics,,0,0,0,,On the lake that personified this energy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:46.32,italics,,0,0,0,,The country was called Deho, after the lake on which it stands
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:51.66,italics,,0,0,0,,People who could control this energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.74,0:12:53.41,italics,,0,0,0,,called magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:58.50,italics,,0,0,0,,This story is about the magicians of Deho, a place that does not exist
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.58,0:13:00.54,italics,,0,0,0,,neither in textbooks nor on maps
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.43,0:13:20.19,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,20 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:31.03,italics,,0,0,0,,So you are Nak Su,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.11,0:13:33.12,italics,,0,0,0,,a warrior who prowls the city
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.74,0:13:35.16,italics,,0,0,0,,and kills magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.24,0:13:36.83,general text,,0,0,0,,My name is Nak Su because,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.91,0:13:39.21,general text,,0,0,0,,that where I won’t go,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:40.46,general text,,0,0,0,,heads fly from shoulders*
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:40.46,notes,,0,0,0,,*her name is similar to the expression
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:42.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Great name, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.13,0:13:45.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Kill her
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.63,0:13:48.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:48.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t let her get away
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:50.44,general text,,0,0,0,,- Catch her\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:05.04,italics,,0,0,0,,There. Follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:16.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.93,0:18:08.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t die here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.14,0:18:10.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.19,0:18:23.28,italics,,0,0,0,,How impatient. Yes I go
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:40.63,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:45.89,italics,,0,0,0,,Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:11.87,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Inn
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:20.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Dead
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.98,0:19:43.69,general text,,0,0,0,,There is no blue mark on it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.49,0:19:50.08,general text,,0,0,0,,The mark proves that her soul has moved to another body
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.49,0:19:52.95,general text,,0,0,0,,It turns out she couldn’t
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:55.50,general text,,0,0,0,,merge with another body?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:29.24,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.70,0:20:33.62,italics,,0,0,0,,Times
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:36.87,italics,,0,0,0,,Two
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:39.71,italics,,0,0,0,,Three
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:01.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, come
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.82,0:21:07.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:09.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.57,0:21:13.70,general text,,0,0,0,,This mark indicates that the soul has left the body
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:17.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Remember her. If someone switches bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:20.96,general text,,0,0,0,,this bruise remains right above the heart
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.08,0:21:24.96,general text,,0,0,0,,So her soul escaped?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.05,0:21:28.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, I tried, but couldn’t
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:31.51,general text,,0,0,0,,This means that the soul has left her,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.59,0:21:35.43,general text,,0,0,0,,but we found no traces that she moved to another body
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.57,0:21:47.94,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is this a whistle\N- A whistle?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:50.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I had the same one when I kept a bird at home
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:55.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Did she have a bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.37,0:21:57.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I think it was for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:21:59.96,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems that he is important to her
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.79,0:22:03.92,general text,,0,0,0,,She is a warrior who killed people left and right,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.00,0:22:08.38,general text,,0,0,0,,but she is still a person. She probably had her own story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.31,0:22:18.89,general text,,0,0,0,,A bunch of people saw Nak Soo's body
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.98,0:22:21.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Rumors are spreading about the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.85,0:22:24.86,general text,,0,0,0,,20 years have passed since we saw the last nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.40,0:22:26.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.48,0:22:30.90,general text,,0,0,0,,He turned into a soul swallower and killed many people
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:35.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it might happen again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.83,0:22:38.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.04,0:22:42.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncle, I heard that Nak Su was a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.37,0:22:45.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Huo, have you seen her too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:48.84,general text,,0,0,0,,And you are quite concerned about rumors
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.92,0:22:51.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Rumors have already spread. I came running as soon as I heard
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.22,0:22:54.05,general text,,0,0,0,,- Where did you hear that?\N- To Chwisongru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.14,0:22:55.85,general text,,0,0,0,,You could Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.93,0:22:59.72,general text,,0,0,0,,And instead of studying, you ran to the poets to pick up rumors
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.27,0:23:05.77,general text,,0,0,0,,In the Pine Forest of Chonjingak, not only spells are cast,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.86,0:23:07.73,general text,,0,0,0,,but they also collect information
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.77,0:23:11.15,general text,,0,0,0,,And our Dan Gu will go
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.24,0:23:13.40,general text,,0,0,0,,in your footsteps
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.49,0:23:15.57,general text,,0,0,0,,and will become the head of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.66,0:23:17.49,general text,,0,0,0,,He must be able to drink
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:18.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Now tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.33,0:23:21.62,general text,,0,0,0,,What is the best thing to drink in Jwiseonru?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.58,0:23:25.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t go there so often now, because Uka isn’t here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.62,0:23:27.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk? Chang Gan's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.71,0:23:32.09,general text,,0,0,0,,He studies writing at the Yeongchundan village school?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.17,0:23:34.26,general text,,0,0,0,,They threw him out of there a long time ago
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.34,0:23:36.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Now he is in Kisan
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:40.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I sent him to study with the Buddhist monk Ho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.52,0:23:45.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk went to the Buddhist temple at such and such a time?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.85,0:23:49.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Today I graduate
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.19,0:23:53.86,general text,,0,0,0,,But you haven’t mastered everything
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.94,0:23:57.07,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you do it without my permission?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:23:58.53,general text,,0,0,0,,You asked to expand my knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.62,0:24:01.45,general text,,0,0,0,,so I have read and memorized hundreds of spell books
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.54,0:24:03.29,general text,,0,0,0,,You asked to train your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.37,0:24:05.92,general text,,0,0,0,,so I patiently sharpened hundreds of swords
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.00,0:24:09.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Only you didn’t teach me a single spell
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.54,0:24:12.88,general text,,0,0,0,,The only thing I learned here is
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.96,0:24:17.47,general text,,0,0,0,,you are not going to teach me spells
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.05,0:24:20.51,general text,,0,0,0,,And now, having learned this lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.60,0:24:22.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to leave this place
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:25.98,general text,,0,0,0,,The head of Sosnovy Bor said to keep you here for three years
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.06,0:24:29.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I know that you are building a temple with the money that I paid you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.44,0:24:32.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I will not ask for compensation, I hope the temple will be completed
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.24,0:24:37.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? I didn't allow you to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.32,0:24:42.74,general text,,0,0,0,,And where did you get the idea that I asked for permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.33,0:24:47.41,italics,,0,0,0,,Conceived due to the mother’s accidental relationship,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.50,0:24:49.17,italics,,0,0,0,,abandoned by his own father,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.25,0:24:51.75,italics,,0,0,0,,what do you know about respect for the master?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.84,0:24:54.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I refuse to teach someone like you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.63,0:24:57.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Respectful student, I’m no good,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.88,0:24:59.51,general text,,0,0,0,,but I know how to collect debts
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.59,0:25:01.18,general text,,0,0,0,,One more word,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.26,0:25:03.47,general text,,0,0,0,,and you will never finish the temple
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.10,0:25:06.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I will demand my money back
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.60,0:25:12.36,general text,,0,0,0,,No one in the world will teach you spells because of your father
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.44,0:25:14.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you for your concern
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.03,0:25:19.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I will find my master
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.28,0:25:23.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Someone incredibly strong and skillful
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.68,0:25:42.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.24,0:26:46.16,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Why did I end up in such a body?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.16,0:26:51.37,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she was blind
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.50,0:26:58.30,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,But what do I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.96,0:27:00.67,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Because the soul is different?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.47,0:27:06.26,offscreen,,0,0,0,,She doesn’t even have a blue mark
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.35,0:27:07.76,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,How unusual
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.85,0:27:11.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Be patient a little, Moo Dok. Soon you won't feel motion sick, you're almost there
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.44,0:27:15.40,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"Moo Dok"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.48,0:27:18.98,voiceover,,0,0,0,,This is a blind girl from the village who was sold to the fort
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.53,0:27:23.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Sit down, you’ll fall
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.87,0:27:36.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the trip
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.21,0:27:38.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll get off here
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.64,0:27:51.93,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.47,0:27:53.85,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Forces have left
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.60,0:27:57.02,offscreen,,0,0,0,,This body can’t even get up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.11,0:28:00.27,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Hands are so weak
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.19,0:28:02.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Ajusshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.03,0:28:04.65,general text,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- What...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.74,0:28:06.49,general text,,0,0,0,,- Ahjusshi\N- Saints...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.57,0:28:07.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.99,0:28:08.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Ajusshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.95,0:28:11.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Turn the boat around. Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.70,0:28:13.29,general text,,0,0,0,,- Heaven...\N- Mu Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.37,0:28:14.46,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I'll fall
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.54,0:28:15.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Ajusshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.47,0:28:31.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you hanging there if you can’t even see?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.64,0:28:32.97,general text,,0,0,0,,You could have gotten hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.81,0:28:36.27,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Everything is very bad
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.35,0:28:38.19,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,My strength has left me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.69,0:28:45.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Feeling sick again?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.82,0:28:49.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm so worried about your weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.62,0:28:51.08,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.16,0:28:53.54,voiceover,,0,0,0,,This body is too weak and unhealthy
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.24,0:28:57.37,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,You can’t change bodies often. Let's stay a little Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.00,0:29:00.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry, ahjusshi
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.38,0:29:01.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.71,0:29:03.38,general text,,0,0,0,,All because of a weak body
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.13,0:29:05.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's eat
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.14,0:29:18.98,general text,,0,0,0,,- Your food\N- Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.06,0:29:20.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Today we will eat
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.90,0:29:22.27,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a chicken. Eat
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.61,0:29:26.11,voiceover,,0,0,0,,As a warrior, I am sensitive to the smell of blood
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.19,0:29:30.07,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I do not eat meat from animals whose blood is the same color as humans
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.16,0:29:31.82,general text,,0,0,0,,- I don’t want\N- Just eat
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.79,0:29:42.42,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,For the first time... I’m eating meat
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.75,0:29:44.92,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Delicious
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.68,0:29:50.76,general text,,0,0,0,,You look
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.84,0:29:54.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I really don’t want to send you there,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.56,0:29:57.35,general text,,0,0,0,,but this is the only place where they agreed to accept a blind person
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.77,0:30:02.90,general text,,0,0,0,,"Where"? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.69,0:30:08.82,italics,,0,0,0,,One woman took her in after the death of her parents
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.90,0:30:11.07,general text,,0,0,0,,But she got sick and died
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.16,0:30:13.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Her debt passed to her due to illness,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.74,0:30:15.62,general text,,0,0,0,,so it is sold here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.70,0:30:16.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.66,0:30:19.91,general text,,0,0,0,,You cannot sell this soul to the kisaeng house
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.00,0:30:22.37,general text,,0,0,0,,- Good luck\N- But...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.54,0:30:27.50,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe that he fed me chicken so that he could sell me here later
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.59,0:30:30.72,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I'll tear you into pieces as soon as I get my strength back
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.22,0:30:33.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Too thin
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.39,0:30:36.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll become nicer if you fill up your cheeks
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.31,0:30:38.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Drop it. won't help me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.31,0:30:41.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I am useless and not suitable for the role of a gisaeng
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.98,0:30:43.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Send me somewhere else
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.44,0:30:45.56,general text,,0,0,0,,And you speak beautifully
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.15,0:30:47.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you still sing
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.40,0:30:49.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope it’s as good as you say
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.53,0:30:55.41,general text,,0,0,0,,First, wash yourself and dress up
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.76,0:31:11.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you even dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.09,0:31:13.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Was it like a dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.13,0:31:17.30,offscreen,,0,0,0,,If I had the same strength, there would be nothing left of my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.52,0:31:23.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm older, so speak respectfully
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.27,0:31:25.60,general text,,0,0,0,,And with guests too
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.69,0:31:28.07,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Wait. I'll kill you too
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.32,0:31:33.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Many influential people come to visit us
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.74,0:31:36.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Four seasons of Daeho are also regulars at Jwisungru
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.08,0:31:39.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Four what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.28,0:31:42.58,general text,,0,0,0,,There are four types of beautiful people in Deho
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.66,0:31:44.75,general text,,0,0,0,,They are called the Four Seasons
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.51,0:32:02.81,italics,,0,0,0,,The daughter of the Jin family, who has the life force of spring
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.64,0:32:04.56,italics,,0,0,0,,Jin Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.08,0:32:22.95,italics,,0,0,0,,The heir of the Pak family, with the energy of a hot summer
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.04,0:32:24.29,italics,,0,0,0,,Pak Dak Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.09,0:32:39.43,italics,,0,0,0,,The genius of the So family, as noble as the sunset in autumn
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.26,0:32:41.26,italics,,0,0,0,,So Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.20,0:33:03.24,italics,,0,0,0,,And the last one is Chan Wook, the successor of the Chan family,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.33,0:33:06.83,italics,,0,0,0,,as dazzling as snow in winter
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.55,0:33:17.30,italics,,0,0,0,,The Jin, Park, Seo and Chan families
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.38,0:33:20.39,general text,,0,0,0,,The most famous magic families in Deho
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.47,0:33:22.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Their children are called the Four Seasons
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.60,0:33:26.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that what they call them in the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.44,0:33:31.40,general text,,0,0,0,,My summer prince has arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.28,0:33:38.36,voiceover,,0,0,0,,If he is the heir of the Park family,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.95,0:33:40.74,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,so, Park Jin's nephew
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.37,0:33:44.28,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Park Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.83,0:33:50.29,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He was there that night too
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.80,0:34:00.84,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.80,0:34:02.93,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.64,0:34:04.85,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Chan
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.56,0:34:06.77,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Pak
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.11,0:34:17.11,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Four seasons
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.57,0:34:22.36,general text,,0,0,0,,When I get to you, it will be the end
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.37,0:34:27.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Meet your death nobly
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.96,0:34:34.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Who do you want to meet today?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.71,0:34:38.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncle said to bring someone
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.13,0:34:41.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring someone? Whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.38,0:34:44.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Student in Kisan,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.09,0:34:47.01,general text,,0,0,0,,who humiliated the master and was exiled
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.14,0:34:50.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's hiding here
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.52,0:34:53.15,general text,,0,0,0,,You look
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.23,0:34:56.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I was yearning for seafood
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.57,0:34:58.57,general text,,0,0,0,,after life in the mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.65,0:35:00.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I think he's there
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.55,0:35:24.80,general text,,0,0,0,,By your grace, my uncle had to
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.89,0:35:27.89,general text,,0,0,0,,go all the way to Kisan to ask the monk for forgiveness
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.97,0:35:32.73,general text,,0,0,0,,And at this time you are eating crabs here
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.81,0:35:34.48,general text,,0,0,0,,No, I won’t eat
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.56,0:35:35.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Too troublesome
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.48,0:35:38.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Glad you came. Break the shell with a spell
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.82,0:35:41.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe it
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.15,0:35:45.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I can break the shell and get the meat
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.20,0:35:47.87,general text,,0,0,0,,But instead of crab I want to try it on you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.95,0:35:51.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu, if only this monk would be so generous as to at least teach me this,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.45,0:35:53.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I wouldn’t leave like that
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.54,0:35:55.21,general text,,0,0,0,,What good is it if you can’t?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.29,0:35:57.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Your father forbade you to cast magic
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.29,0:35:58.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Then he should help me with this
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.96,0:36:02.46,general text,,0,0,0,,This is what teachers do. They help students
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.55,0:36:05.22,general text,,0,0,0,,There is no one in Deho so brave,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.30,0:36:07.47,general text,,0,0,0,,to go against your father
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.55,0:36:09.14,general text,,0,0,0,,But there are those who live without fear
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.22,0:36:10.43,general text,,0,0,0,,For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.39,0:36:13.31,general text,,0,0,0,,that warrior Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.69,0:36:18.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t be ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.90,0:36:22.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that she is so strong that even the leader is too tough
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.44,0:36:24.78,general text,,0,0,0,,She's dead
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.45,0:36:28.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Her soul left her body, which means she can be alive
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.78,0:36:31.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Who told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.79,0:36:34.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think I came here to eat crabs?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.45,0:36:35.71,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s fastest here
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.79,0:36:37.96,general text,,0,0,0,,find out the news of our country
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.50,0:36:39.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Get the meat already
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.00,0:36:42.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Use the spell to your advantage, get the meat
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.88,0:36:46.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Can’t you do it yourself, are you so lazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.64,0:36:52.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I took a bath and just bloomed
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.22,0:36:53.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me paint you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.60,0:36:57.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Unnie, myself
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.19,0:36:59.90,general text,,0,0,0,,But how? You're blind
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.19,0:37:03.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I have never done this,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.19,0:37:05.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to prepare
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.74,0:37:08.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to be alone for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.78,0:37:13.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course. Come out when you're ready
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.17,0:37:26.42,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s easier to fool people by pretending to be blind
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.59,0:37:29.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Need money to escape
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.76,0:37:33.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this real gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.76,0:37:36.27,general text,,0,0,0,,This is jade
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.10,0:37:40.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, try this new blush
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.81,0:37:42.69,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.23,0:37:46.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Unni, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.45,0:37:51.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.58,0:38:03.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Catch Moo Dok! Catch the thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.80,0:38:10.09,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Too high
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.48,0:38:19.35,italics,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.12,0:38:44.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Where are you looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.39,0:39:03.52,general text,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.44,0:39:12.82,general text,,0,0,0,,No sound
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.66,0:39:17.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard the blind girl arrived today
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.16,0:39:19.20,general text,,0,0,0,,And you see
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.21,0:39:23.96,general text,,0,0,0,,They told me your name
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.04,0:39:26.08,general text,,0,0,0,,On “D” or something like that
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.17,0:39:27.25,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.59,0:39:29.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Remembered
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.71,0:39:31.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.38,0:39:35.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.55,0:39:39.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I know what you look like,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.35,0:39:41.64,general text,,0,0,0,,if you don’t stay quiet until I leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.73,0:39:43.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll come for you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.44,0:39:48.48,general text,,0,0,0,,What's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.48,0:39:51.82,general text,,0,0,0,,You have beautiful eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.65,0:39:55.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.78,0:39:59.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, sorry. Only the eyes are beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.75,0:40:02.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Moron
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.84,0:40:10.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.38,0:40:12.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.30,0:40:16.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, that’s a small thing
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.85,0:40:20.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Just
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.06,0:40:22.02,general text,,0,0,0,,take this
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.44,0:40:26.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.62,0:40:48.46,general text,,0,0,0,,- What’s there?\N- Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.84,0:40:54.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.38,0:40:59.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard Nak Soo uses Tansu
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.34,0:41:01.26,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you know about Tansu?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.35,0:41:03.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough. Read in my free time
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.35,0:41:05.27,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Tansu
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.98,0:41:07.69,general text,,0,0,0,,You see, Tansu
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.77,0:41:11.11,general text,,0,0,0,,the art of wielding a sword, which only the best magicians can master
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.19,0:41:13.98,general text,,0,0,0,,You hit the blade with energy, as if pouring water
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.07,0:41:16.53,general text,,0,0,0,,One hit is enough to kill
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.29,0:41:28.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.29,0:41:32.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Just wondering if this crab could have killed me
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.84,0:41:35.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Come here. Give it to me, I'll get the meat...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.22,0:41:40.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk, this is a vital point
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.93,0:41:43.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I may die
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.26,0:41:45.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. She also aimed at this point
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.56,0:41:51.56,general text,,0,0,0,,But why did she retreat then?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.19,0:42:00.57,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Why is this weak body always hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.66,0:42:02.91,general text,,0,0,0,,If I don’t eat, I’ll become weaker
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.45,0:42:04.78,general text,,0,0,0,,No exit
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.46,0:42:17.76,offscreen,,0,0,0,,You can’t fight now, you have to hold back
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.51,0:42:25.14,general text,,0,0,0,,The Mages of Jeonjingak are here
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.56,0:42:32.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that the killer entered Jeongjingak in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.98,0:42:35.06,general text,,0,0,0,,What fool would risk infiltrating Jeonjingak?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.15,0:42:37.36,italics,,0,0,0,,She attacked the head, but was caught
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.44,0:42:38.90,italics,,0,0,0,,It was a young girl
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.19,0:43:14.60,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He should have seen my dead body
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.69,0:43:16.15,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Most likely, he didn’t recognize me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.27,0:43:20.90,offscreen,,0,0,0,,I’m sure he didn’t recognize the whistle either
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.29,0:43:33.00,general text,,0,0,0,,There are no traces of Nak Su here either
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.71,0:43:36.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I think she couldn't find a new body
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.59,0:43:40.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Even if she succeeded, she is most likely hiding,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.42,0:43:42.72,general text,,0,0,0,,because I encountered a problem
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.80,0:43:45.59,general text,,0,0,0,,The warrior who revealed himself must be destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.05,0:43:50.01,general text,,0,0,0,,We will need to steal her body and sword
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.10,0:43:52.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Get rid of all traces of her
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.43,0:43:56.40,general text,,0,0,0,,What if she's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.98,0:44:00.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Or she will be killed for changing her body,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.44,0:44:02.69,general text,,0,0,0,,or her soul will not get along with the new body,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.78,0:44:04.40,general text,,0,0,0,,and will turn to stone
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.99,0:44:07.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I raised her to be the best mercenary
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.32,0:44:09.58,general text,,0,0,0,,What a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.96,0:44:19.54,general text,,0,0,0,,How much longer will you look?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.63,0:44:23.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Dear little thing, we need to look carefully
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.67,0:44:26.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking for much. Name your price and pay
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.35,0:44:30.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.14,0:44:32.72,general text,,0,0,0,,- Here she is{\i0}\N- What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.81,0:44:33.93,italics,,0,0,0,,Take her away
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.57,0:44:52.08,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Where am I? Have I been caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.29,0:44:54.83,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Then this is Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.04,0:44:59.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.50,0:45:01.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.88,0:45:08.80,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the house of Mr. Chang Gan, the head of Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.39,0:45:12.56,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan? So this is the Chan family's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.98,0:45:21.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did the young master take it into his head to bring you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.52,0:45:24.03,general text,,0,0,0,,- Master?{\i1}\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.11,0:45:27.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Chan Wook bought you from the gisaeng house
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.99,0:45:31.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you stole his amber amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.53,0:45:34.83,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Just take it
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.87,0:45:38.08,memories,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.00,0:45:40.75,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Why did he bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.83,0:45:43.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I was scared when he said he would bring a girl home,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.38,0:45:46.17,general text,,0,0,0,,but when I saw you, I calmed down
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.26,0:45:47.92,general text,,0,0,0,,He helped you out of pity
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.72,0:45:51.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Here, change your clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.09,0:45:52.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.39,0:45:54.39,general text,,0,0,0,,- What is this?{\i1}\N- What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.47,0:45:56.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Clothing of the master's maid
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.35,0:46:00.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Besides, you must address me with respect
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.98,0:46:03.56,general text,,0,0,0,,The young master is weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.65,0:46:05.53,general text,,0,0,0,,he gets tired quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.61,0:46:07.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Do everything quickly as soon as he asks
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.44,0:46:12.07,general text,,0,0,0,,And always smile, no matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.28,0:46:14.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.54,0:46:17.62,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes{\i1}\N- Good
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.20,0:46:21.62,general text,,0,0,0,,He wanted to see you as soon as possible, change clothes and go to him
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.71,0:46:22.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t hear
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.50,0:46:24.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.80,0:46:26.63,general text,,0,0,0,,unnie
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.34,0:46:30.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Call me mistress
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.55,0:46:35.72,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.93,0:46:38.60,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Why did he bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.81,0:46:43.19,memories,,0,0,0,,You have beautiful eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.27,0:46:45.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Fell in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.11,0:46:48.53,general text,,0,0,0,,This face?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.19,0:46:51.82,general text,,0,0,0,,He has bad taste
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.50,0:47:01.71,offscreen,,0,0,0,,In any case, it will be safer for me
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.79,0:47:04.21,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,live here until I recover
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.67,0:47:09.71,voiceover,,0,0,0,,If he fell in love with me, he will treat me well
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.88,0:47:12.47,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.55,0:47:16.35,voiceover,,0,0,0,,guess I'll have to live here as Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.72,0:47:20.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Master, it’s me, Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.60,0:47:22.73,italics,,0,0,0,,Enter
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.78,0:47:34.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Host
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.78,0:47:36.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for saving me
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.91,0:47:39.33,general text,,0,0,0,,and brought here
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.37,0:47:42.46,general text,,0,0,0,,A couple of people were enough to bring you here
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.17,0:47:46.88,general text,,0,0,0,,- I'm disappointed\N- I know it was rude of me
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.96,0:47:51.01,general text,,0,0,0,,threaten you with a crab leg, but I hope you forget about it
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.09,0:47:52.59,general text,,0,0,0,,You are much more polite now
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.67,0:47:54.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I will serve you well
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.43,0:47:56.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Great, try
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.01,0:47:59.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok, bring me some water
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.14,0:48:01.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, master
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.56,0:48:09.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Holy heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.02,0:48:11.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to drink, but to wash myself
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.65,0:48:14.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah, I understand you, master
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.28,0:48:21.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I decided that I’d better take a bath
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.25,0:48:29.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah, hot
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.71,0:48:31.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Too hot
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.34,0:48:34.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, master
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.06,0:48:42.56,general text,,0,0,0,,And now it’s cold
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.14,0:48:45.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Icy water
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.02,0:48:49.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.27,0:48:51.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Icy. I will get sick if I wash in cold water
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.48,0:48:55.28,general text,,0,0,0,,- It’s so cold
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.48,0:48:55.28,voiceover,,0,0,0,,- What’s wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.36,0:48:56.53,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Didn’t he fall in love with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.61,0:48:58.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is Mu Dok frozen?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.28,0:49:02.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, master. I'll get some more hot water
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.33,0:49:09.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Salty
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.04,0:49:11.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Sweet. Spicy
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.13,0:49:12.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Long. What kind of taste is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.75,0:49:14.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t eat this
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.47,0:49:19.18,general text,,0,0,0,,The water has a strange smell
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.89,0:49:20.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.80,0:49:23.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring another bucket
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.18,0:49:27.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring a new blanket
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.06,0:49:30.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Today I want to cover myself with blue
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.71,0:49:56.59,general text,,0,0,0,,He does nothing but washes himself three times a day
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.51,0:50:01.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.76,0:50:05.39,general text,,0,0,0,,As soon as my strength returns, I’ll kill him first
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.56,0:50:12.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Master, I brought cold water
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.06,0:50:15.48,general text,,0,0,0,,- I brought...\N- Forget it, the water has cooled down
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.57,0:50:17.03,general text,,0,0,0,,to the desired temperature
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.49,0:50:19.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Well done...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.65,0:50:22.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah, no. I tried in vain, Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.21,0:50:34.63,voiceover,,0,0,0,,If only I had the strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.42,0:50:38.67,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,At least a grain of the former strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.81,0:50:52.02,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.73,0:50:55.98,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.00,0:51:14.17,italics,,0,0,0,,Are you having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.58,0:51:16.50,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.55,0:51:19.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.17,0:51:21.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.34,0:51:22.93,general text,,0,0,0,,The water is pleasant
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.88,0:51:25.18,general text,,0,0,0,,My things
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.26,0:51:26.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, master
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.44,0:51:36.27,general text,,0,0,0,,What’s up?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.98,0:51:39.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Your things
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.69,0:51:43.65,general text,,0,0,0,,You can go and rest
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.32,0:51:45.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, master
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.33,0:52:01.42,general text,,0,0,0,,This amulet will allow me to destroy the barrier and get into Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.34,0:52:04.97,general text,,0,0,0,,But now I can’t do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.05,0:52:07.14,general text,,0,0,0,,no strength to cast a spell
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.76,0:52:10.01,general text,,0,0,0,,You need to find your sword
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.56,0:52:14.48,italics,,0,0,0,,Perhaps my power will return if I find him
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.94,0:52:19.40,general text,,0,0,0,,With this amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.32,0:52:22.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I can get to Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.95,0:52:30.78,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.95,0:52:35.21,general text,,0,0,0,,How long do you plan to keep Nak Soo’s body in Jeongjingak?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.87,0:52:37.96,general text,,0,0,0,,If she can find a new body,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.50,0:52:39.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.59,0:52:42.00,general text,,0,0,0,,will return for the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.76,0:52:47.01,general text,,0,0,0,,She will come here for her body
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.34,0:52:50.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's see how everything turns out
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.10,0:53:00.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Your father’s room is always empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.07,0:53:02.69,general text,,0,0,0,,but it’s never dusty here
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.78,0:53:05.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I wonder when he will return
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.53,0:53:12.99,italics,,0,0,0,,The portrait of your mother began to fade
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.62,0:53:16.08,italics,,0,0,0,,We need to call an artist to restore
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.77,0:53:41.23,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I learned all the books you told me to read
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.81,0:53:43.86,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Now teach me how to cast spells,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.94,0:53:46.03,memories italics,,0,0,0,,as taught by Yulia and Dan Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.62,0:53:57.33,memories,,0,0,0,,This sword belongs to your father
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.41,0:53:58.71,memories,,0,0,0,,Take it
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.84,0:54:13.93,memories,,0,0,0,,A spell has been cast on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.01,0:54:16.52,memories,,0,0,0,,because of which I cannot take the enchanted sword
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.02,0:54:19.27,memories,,0,0,0,,You can’t even pick up your father’s sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.35,0:54:21.02,memories,,0,0,0,,How do you want to learn spells?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.10,0:54:23.98,memories,,0,0,0,,Why can’t you open the gate of my energy so that I can practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.06,0:54:24.98,memories,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.19,0:54:27.57,memories,,0,0,0,,can’t do this
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.94,0:54:32.36,memories,,0,0,0,,Then find me another teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.07,0:54:34.49,memories,,0,0,0,,No one can do this
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.41,0:54:37.87,memories,,0,0,0,,No one in Daeho can resist your father
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.95,0:54:39.87,memories,,0,0,0,,and open the gates of your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.96,0:54:41.42,memories,,0,0,0,,So you mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.37,0:54:44.25,memories,,0,0,0,,will I never be able to master spells?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.34,0:54:45.29,memories,,0,0,0,,This is fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.38,0:54:49.55,memories,,0,0,0,,which your father gave you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.51,0:54:52.38,memories,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.47,0:54:54.39,memories,,0,0,0,,Why does he control my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.64,0:54:58.02,memories,,0,0,0,,Still, no one considers him my real father
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.56,0:55:01.02,memories,,0,0,0,,I'll find someone
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.10,0:55:06.11,memories,,0,0,0,,Teacher who will reveal my powers and teach me magic
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.94,0:55:08.73,memories,,0,0,0,,I'll find him myself
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.11,0:55:12.49,memories,,0,0,0,,And then I will take out this sword and split it in two
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.72,0:55:41.18,italics,,0,0,0,,I heard Mr. Chan was expelled again
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.85,0:55:45.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is the son of the great Master Chan always getting into trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.15,0:55:46.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Because he is not his son
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.94,0:55:49.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Do Hwa, the most beautiful woman in Daeho,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.36,0:55:51.74,general text,,0,0,0,,cheated on him with another man and gave birth to Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.32,0:55:53.95,italics,,0,0,0,,I doubt this is true
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.03,0:55:57.12,italics,,0,0,0,,Then why did he deprive his son of the ability to use magic
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.20,0:55:59.12,italics,,0,0,0,,and condemned to the life of a slacker?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.12,0:56:04.16,italics,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's really that weak because of his father's spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.88,0:56:15.84,offscreen,,0,0,0,,The amulet should be here somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.15,0:56:31.61,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.65,0:56:58.48,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Why am I hiding here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.65,0:57:01.11,offscreen,,0,0,0,,What will he think of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.65,0:57:03.11,voiceover,,0,0,0,,What should I tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.97,0:57:11.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t bring you here for this
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.64,0:57:14.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.19,0:57:17.77,general text,,0,0,0,,you kept repeating that you were cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.86,0:57:19.90,general text,,0,0,0,,so I decided to warm your bed
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.98,0:57:22.86,general text,,0,0,0,,If you lie down now, you will be warm all night
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.94,0:57:24.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.70,0:57:26.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Nice of you
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.29,0:57:33.50,general text,,0,0,0,,- Good night\N- Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.66,0:57:37.04,general text,,0,0,0,,You came to warm me this night
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.79,0:57:40.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.75,0:57:41.88,general text,,0,0,0,,to my bed
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.21,0:57:44.34,general text,,0,0,0,,was warm all night
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.43,0:57:47.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Warm her
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.85,0:57:55.02,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What? Does he really like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.10,0:57:56.69,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Did I fall for his tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.07,0:58:05.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Host,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.90,0:58:09.49,general text,,0,0,0,,my body heat is not enough to warm you
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.57,0:58:11.58,italics,,0,0,0,,Since childhood I have been constantly cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.66,0:58:14.41,general text,,0,0,0,,that's why I have a low body temperature
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.42,0:58:22.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Like this
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.27,0:58:39.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to do what you want me to do
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.15,0:58:51.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Move the brazier closer
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.41,0:58:56.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Brazier?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.16,0:59:00.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I just wanted you to put the brazier closer to the bed
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.29,0:59:01.38,general text,,0,0,0,,and kept the fire going there
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.71,0:59:07.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t let it go out
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.80,0:59:14.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.26,0:59:17.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Too close
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.48,0:59:19.94,general text,,0,0,0,,It will be hot
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.81,0:59:22.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly. Too hot
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.78,0:59:28.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I will sell you if the fire goes out
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.74,0:59:30.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Keep him up all night
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.45,0:59:31.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.46,0:59:46.80,italics,,0,0,0,,Here comes Dan Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.30,0:59:52.51,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this? Whistle
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.26,0:59:54.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.05,0:59:56.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I made it
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.81,1:00:00.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, exactly. I remembered. You had a bird
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.10,1:00:01.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you going to start another one?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.27,1:00:04.48,general text,,0,0,0,,No, that’s not the point
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.56,1:00:06.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I found it in an unexpected place
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.65,1:00:09.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I wonder why she had it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.99,1:00:11.20,italics,,0,0,0,,Maybe you gave it to her yourself
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.78,1:00:13.86,general text,,0,0,0,,You could just forget about it
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.95,1:00:15.03,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.91,1:00:18.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I clearly remember who I gave it to
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.30,1:00:38.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Then ask her
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.94,1:00:47.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you going to see her at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.77,1:00:49.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Need to check something
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.43,1:02:45.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.62,1:03:02.87,italics,,0,0,0,,Invasion!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.58,1:03:05.29,italics,,0,0,0,,We are under attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.37,1:03:06.66,italics,,0,0,0,,Criminals
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.14,1:04:06.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Leaving
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.42,1:04:38.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.00,1:05:21.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, what’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.18,1:05:26.64,general text,,0,0,0,,The classroom is on fire
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.60,1:05:36.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is in Jeonjingak now?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.40,1:05:37.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Yul and Dan Gu
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.11,1:05:42.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncle, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.69,1:05:44.90,general text,,0,0,0,,The attackers escaped
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.07,1:05:48.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Jeonjingak is empty
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.54,1:06:00.96,general text,,0,0,0,,- Find them\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.43,1:06:13.06,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Who were they?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.06,1:06:15.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Did Dan Zhu really send them?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.06,1:06:22.44,memories,,0,0,0,,This time you must bring the soul of Pak Jin, the head of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.24,1:06:27.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.45,1:06:30.66,general text,,0,0,0,,He must have sent them to get my body back
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.54,1:06:39.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Who's here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.99,1:07:13.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Boss?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.09,1:07:29.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.97,1:07:34.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Because of your eyes
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.43,1:07:36.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Eye?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.00,1:08:00.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I understood everything in our first meeting
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.29,1:08:04.71,general text,,0,0,0,,You are my teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.46,1:08:51.84,preview,,0,0,0,,Nomad, mercenary warrior, Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.92,1:08:56.14,preview,,0,0,0,,I was looking for a man who would break the spell and become my master
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.22,1:08:57.76,preview,,0,0,0,,I want you to become him
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.85,1:08:59.47,preview,,0,0,0,,What nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.14,1:09:02.93,preview,,0,0,0,,They want to grab Nak Soo, she’s in one of these people
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.02,1:09:06.48,preview,,0,0,0,,We will find this nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.19,1:09:08.69,preview,,0,0,0,,If they catch me, pretend you don't know anything
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.48,1:09:12.24,preview,,0,0,0,,Stand next to me
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.32,1:09:15.86,preview,,0,0,0,,The people I met along the way only wanted me dead
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.16,1:09:21.66,preview,,0,0,0,,You are the first person who tried to save me
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.75,1:09:24.00,preview,,0,0,0,,If we meet face to face again,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.08,1:09:25.17,preview,,0,0,0,,I'll leave you alive
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.26,1:11:06.26,title,,0,0,0,,

Comment: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:47.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Beta editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Sana
